Niagara BP component-template durable executor:

```text
execute_blueprint_niagara_component_template_asset_swap_durable(
  blueprint_path="/Game/MCPWeather/BP_MCPWeatherManager",
  component_name="RainFX",
  source_system_path="/Game/MCPWeather/FX/Rain/NS_MCPWeather_Rain",
  replacement_system_path="/Game/MCPWeather/Generated/NS_MCPWeather_SourceTemplate_Rain",
  confirmation_token="ALLOW_DURABLE_BP_COMPONENT_TEMPLATE_EXECUTE",
  dry_run=True
)
```

The command defaults to dry-run. Real execution is rejected unless the original
Blueprint package is clean, exactly one local SCS `UNiagaraComponent` template
matches the source system, `compile_blueprint=true`, `save_blueprint=true`, and
the explicit durable execute token are supplied. When it saves, it performs a
static UnrealMCP/MCP marker scan on the saved `.uasset`.

