This read-only bundle runs the evidence review, finalize dry-run, and status/delete-readiness check together, then writes `Docs/Analysis/MCPWeatherNiagara/mcpweather_release_candidate_offline_verify_20260630.json`. Use `--require-cleanup-complete` or `--require-delete-ready` for stricter post-cleanup or pre-delete gates.

